7. IMPORTANT SCOPE CHECK: what did the original atlas actually scan?
==============================================================================
  m003_pair_atlas.csv records 136 pairs at the cusp, over 17 distinct words.
  Full word universe: 99 words, C(99,2) = 4851 possible pairs.
  => the original atlas's degeneracy scan (Thm.~thm:universal /
     manuscript 'four squared-trace degeneracies') is a CURATED
     136-pair / 17-word subset, NOT an
     exhaustive check of the full 99-word universe. This
     script's collision scan (Section 5 above) IS exhaustive over the
     full universe and is not a contradiction of the atlas result --
     it completes a check the atlas never performed.

==============================================================================
8. control test: is X_0's collision density generic to any rank-1 cut?
==============================================================================
  X_0 itself: y=1-t^2, z=-1/t               : 58 distinct classes, 25 groups, largest group = 4
  control A: generic line y=t, z=t          : 33 distinct classes, 29 groups, largest group = 6
  control B: generic line y=t+1, z=t-1      : 77 distinct classes, 22 groups, largest group = 2
  control C: same shape, y=t^2, z=1/t       : 80 distinct classes, 18 groups, largest group = 3
  control D: sign-flipped z, y=1-t^2, z=+1/t: 81 distinct classes, 18 groups, largest group = 2
  control E: shifted, y=2-t^2, z=-1/t       : 78 distinct classes, 19 groups, largest group = 3

  X_0 is markedly MORE collapsed than the shape-matched-but-arbitrary
  controls C/D/E (58 vs 78-81 classes), so the collision density is
  tied to X_0's actual defining constants, not merely 'any 1-parameter
  cut of similar shape'. But an even more special arbitrary line
  (control A, y=z=t) collapses further still (33 classes) -- so raw
  collision COUNT is not by itself a rare/exceptional statistic in
  this space of substitutions. NOT YET A THEOREM: this motivates but
  does not establish that X_0's specific collisions are meaningful.

